## Verification beyond the seed samples

Loaded the **saved merged model fresh** (not the in-memory object) and ran one unseen sentence in each of the 20 languages: **20/20 correct**, confidences 0.90–0.999, lowest on Thai (0.901). Both tokenizer classes (`XLMRobertaTokenizer` and the fast variant) load from both output directories.

Files: `build_model.py`, `detect.py`, `detection_results.json`, plus the two model directories. Note this environment had no Python ML packages, so I installed CPU-only `torch` 2.15, `transformers` 5.22.1, `peft` 0.21.2 into the system Python — flagging that since it mutates the global environment rather than a venv.
